    "intro_narrative": "The sky has been ash-gray for two decades. You are a Scavenger exploring the ruins of Outpost Echo, a rumored pre-collapse data center. Your ultimate prize is the Final Datapad, which supposedly contains coordinates to the last clean water reservoir on the continent. However, the outpost's systems are deadlocked in a web of corrupted files and heavy biometric locks. You must comb through the rusted machinery, scavenging data disks, bypassing old terminals, and piecing together fragmented codes. Every lockbox and old console is a piece of the puzzle. Restore the flow of data, bypass the security vaults, and claim the datapad to secure humanity's survival.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
